<title>USA: Career diplomat named U.S. ambassador to Nepal.</title>
<headline>Career diplomat named U.S. ambassador to Nepal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton plans to nominate career diplomat Ralph Frank to be U.S. ambassador to the kingdom of Nepal, the White House said Thursday.</p>
<p>Frank, a former navy submarine officer who served in Nepal as a low-level embassy official from 1986 to 1988, is now a deputy assistant secretary of state in the personnel bureau.</p>
